sprites-hard 2026-11-25: queen_face.png = the same Ouroboros Queen illustration (Isaac Murgadella for The Ouroboros King, Oriol Cosp Games) from the official press kit, Google Drive folder linked from https://oriolcosp.com/the-ouroboros-king (Art/ouroS3.png, 2416x4806 transparent RGBA). Head + collar cut (mirror masked off, cut flat at the collar), fitted 512px ~92%, bottom-flush, no edge fading. Note: the press-kit crown is darker than the video's red-tinted crown.
blurry-b 2026-11-26: relic/HUD icons replaced with the same game-icons.net icons the game uses, rendered from SVG at 512px white on transparent (CC BY 3.0): draw_offer=delapouite/shaking-hands, gold=lorc/cash, item_rewind=delapouite/anticlockwise-rotation, relic_finisher=delapouite/flanged-mace, relic_sigil=lorc/ouroboros, relic_wings=lorc/angel-outfit; relic_bell=lorc/ringing-bell (closest alternate; the game's framed bell icon was not found).
